OL,3,GNEWSAThousands of runners take part in
OL,4,ACardiff Half Marathon
OL,5,
OL,6,FAbout 30,000 runners were expected to
OL,7,Fhave taken part in the Cardiff Half
OL,8,FMarathon on Sunday which saw a new
OL,9,Frecord broken.
OL,11,FKenya's Joyciline Jepkosgei - the first
OL,12,Fathlete in history to run under 65
OL,13,Fminutes for a half marathon - set a new
OL,14,Fwomen's course record with a time of
OL,15,F1:05:40.
OL,17,FKenyan Gideon Kiprotich won the men's
OL,18,Frace in 59:43, while the men's
OL,19,Fwheelchair race was won by Poland's Sam
OL,20,FKolek and Mel Nicholls won the women's
OL,21,Fevent.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,439,430,260,140,0,100
