OL,3,GNEWSAThousands of runners take part in
OL,4,ACardiff Half Marathon
OL,5,
OL,6,FWidespread road closures were in place
OL,7,Fto accommodate the 13.1 mile (21km)
OL,8,Froute, after the race started on Castle
OL,9,FStreet at 10:00 BST.
